OL,3,GNEWSATeen violinist wins top spot in
OL,4,Anational orchestra
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage violinist from West Yorkshire
OL,7,Fhas been chosen to lead a prestigious
OL,8,Fyouth orchestra.
OL,10,FJames Jet Uttley, 17, from Bingley near
OL,11,FBradford, has played violin in the
OL,12,FNational Youth Orchestra (NYO) for four
OL,13,Fyears and has been selected to be first
OL,14,Fviolinist and lead the 160-strong
OL,15,Fensemble in 2027.
OL,17,FJames undertook two rounds of auditions
OL,18,Fto secure the opportunity, which he
OL,19,Fsaid was something he had always
OL,20,F"dreamed" of doing.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
