OL,3,GNEWSATeen violinist wins top spot in
OL,4,Anational orchestra
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's something I've worked quite hard
OL,7,Ffor and I couldn't really imagine from
OL,8,Fwhen I first started that I would be
OL,9,Fleader," he said.
